700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\"><span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> お子様用アメニティやキッズメニュー、家族向け和室・温泉露天などが揃っており、ご家族皆様で安心してご滞在いただけます。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！静岡県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 静岡県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/atami-izusan-ajiro-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】熱海・伊豆山おすすめホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">熱海市（熱海駅前・サンビーチ・熱海港・伊豆山・網代）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/atami-oceanview-hotel-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】熱海オーシャンビューホテルおすすめ特集｜相模湾の絶景＆花火大会ビュー！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">熱海</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-tokai-shizuhama-maguro-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl